LICENCE — PLACEHOLDER, NOT YET DETERMINED
=========================================

No licence is granted by this file.

This repository is private and proprietary. All rights are reserved by the
copyright holder. No permission is granted to any person to use, copy, modify,
merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, or sell any part of this software.

Why this file is a placeholder
------------------------------

The licence text cannot be completed yet because the copyright holder is not
yet determined:

  - Open Item B (legal entity and jurisdiction) is open. The entity that will
    hold the copyright has not been confirmed.
  - The intellectual-property assignment route recorded in the P1-E IP ownership
    register has not been agreed.

Naming a holder here before those are resolved would assert an ownership
position that has not been decided.

P0 `11` §2 records the standing position: "Licence: None — private,
proprietary. Add LICENSE only if the repository is ever opened." This file
exists because the current assignment asked for a licence placeholder. It
deliberately grants nothing and names nobody.

What must happen before this file becomes a real licence
-------------------------------------------------------

  1. Open Item B closes — legal entity and jurisdiction confirmed.
  2. The IP assignment route is agreed and executed.
  3. A licence is chosen deliberately (remaining proprietary is a valid choice).
  4. This file is replaced in full, and the change is recorded in CHANGELOG.md.

Until then, the paragraph at the top of this file is the operative statement.
